 foes and overcome perilous obstacles. Be wary! As you travel, you will encounter few safe havens to rest - and even fewer friends to assist, so you must be careful! Take back what belongs to the people of this world, bring the hammer of justice down on <u><i>Drasorin</i></u>, and be the great Hero that everyone needs!<br><br>The bards of legend are ready to compose your <i>Fantasy Story</i> \u2026 are you?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/334dda581ff489dc4f5bd7733be7e8fb.avif?t=1624072411\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/813ff565b221e1a590a9b69b0c254fa0.webp?t=1624072411\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/08cdefe2c4c5da09a490d12477e228eb.poster.avif?t=1624072411\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/08cdefe2c4c5da09a490d12477e228eb.apng?t=1624072411\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Xinput Controller Support. Sit back and relax!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/08cdefe2c4c5da09a490d12477e228eb.poster.avif?t=1624072411\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/08cdefe2c4c5da09a490d12477e228eb.apng?t=1624072411\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Steam Achievements. Track your legendary story!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264840/extras/08cdefe2c4c5da09a490d12477e228eb.poster.avif?t=1624072411\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-mo